{"chunk_id": "21cb32d55c5e", "text": "Arjuna continues an extreme ascetic penance in the Himalayas, progressively reducing his food until he lives on air, standing on tiptoe with arms raised. The intensity of his austerities disturbs the sages, who appeal to Shiva. Shiva reassures them, revealing he knows Arjuna\u2019s wish and will grant it. Disguised as a Kirata (mountain hunter) and accompanied by Uma and a wild retinue, Shiva descends to test him. At that moment the demon Muka appears as a boar to kill Arjuna. Both Arjuna and the disguised Shiva shoot the beast simultaneously, leading to a dispute over who struck first. Their quarrel escalates into a fierce duel. Arjuna unleashes torrents of arrows, yet the mysterious hunter stands unmoved, astonishing him and hinting that he faces no ordinary opponent.\nShiva, disguised as a Kirata hunter, confronts Arjuna after they simultaneously slay a demon boar, leading to a fierce but mysterious duel.\nThemes: divine disguise, ascetic power, trial of a hero, divine encounter, martial pride", "vector": [0.0037638067733496428, -0.014242162927985191, -0.0033318668138235807, 0.037292513996362686, 0.00605393573641777, 0.029026368632912636, -0.035530876368284225, -0.030923517420887947, -0.02005556784570217, -0.03677757456898689, 0.004034827928990126, 0.00372992898337543, 0.0069449180737137794, -0.0049529122188687325, -0.003050682134926319, 0.0027779671363532543, 0.04835018143057823, -0.017318254336714745, 0.022630268707871437, -0.008543943054974079, -0.011918156407773495, 0.013612039387226105, -0.013090323656797409, 0.01005488634109497, -0.01989295519888401, 0.00962802767753601, 0.011308358982205391, -0.027156323194503784, -0.009804191067814827, -0.01307677198201418, -0.010671459138393402, 0.001347483485005796, -0.0007690226193517447, -0.01227725949138403, -0.030489884316921234, 0.004424420651048422, 0.008882719092071056, -0.0173318050801754, 0.017562173306941986, 0.014580939896404743, 0.010102314874529839, 0.001285656704567372